# Branching

- main is protected and is not a pull request target. Do not commit directly to it.
- develop is the only integration branch.
- All work is a short-lived branch and a pull request into develop, never main.
- Branch name: <type>/SLOTLY-<number>-<short-slug>, where type is feature, fix, or chore.
- One ticket per branch. Do not mix unrelated tickets.
- Do not force-push main. Do not rewrite history on a branch someone else is reviewing.
